@lk.go.au ui.diagram.anchor edge=?e at=?at side=auto x=?cx y=?cy
@lk.go.ai ui.diagram.aim edge=?e at=?at x=?ax y=?ay
@lk.go.dx core.calc out=?dx fn=sub args=?ax args=?cx
@lk.go.dy core.calc out=?dy fn=sub args=?ay args=?cy
