@lk.cs.x1 core.calc out=?x1a fn=mul args=?px args=?a
@lk.cs.x2 core.calc out=?x2a fn=mul args=?cx args=?b
@lk.cs.x3 core.calc out=?x3a fn=mul args=?qx args=?c
